    {
      "exercise": "852",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "在同一坐标系中画抛物线 $y=x^2$ 和直线 $y=x+2$。抛物线可取点 $(-2,4)$、$(-1,1)$、$(0,0)$、$(1,1)$、$(2,4)$；直线可取点 $(-2,0)$、$(0,2)$、$(2,4)$。\n两图像交于 $(-1,1)$ 和 $(2,4)$，所以方程的根为 $x=-1$、$x=2$。\n在两交点之间，抛物线位于直线下方，因此 $x^2<x+2$ 的解集是 $(-1,2)$。\n在两交点外侧，抛物线位于直线上方，因此 $x^2>x+2$ 的解集是 $(-\\infty,-1)\\cup(2,+\\infty)$。\n两个不等式都是严格不等式，不包括交点的横坐标。因式分解 $x^2-x-2=(x+1)(x-2)$ 可核验图上读得的边界。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "Three tasks. Student-produced graph explained with shared-frame plotting points; exact algebra validates the observed graph boundaries."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "853",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "先把每个方程化成 $x^2=mx+n$，在同一坐标系中画 $y=x^2$ 与对应直线 $y=mx+n$，读取交点的横坐标。直线用下列两个点即可确定；抛物线可沿用第 852 题的作图方法。\na) $y=-3x+4$，取 $(0,4)$、$(1,1)$。交点横坐标为 $-4$、$1$。\nb) $y=2x+5$，取 $(0,5)$、$(-2,1)$。读图约得 $x\\approx-1.45$、$x\\approx3.45$；准确值 $1-\\sqrt{6}$、$1+\\sqrt{6}$ 用于核验图解近似。\nc) $y=-2x-5$，取 $(0,-5)$、$(-2,-1)$。直线与抛物线没有实交点，实根集合为空；代数核验为 $(x+1)^2=-4$。\nd) $y=\\frac{x+3}{2}$，取 $(-3,0)$、$(1,2)$。交点横坐标为 $-1$、$1.5$。\ne) $y=\\frac{-2x+5}{3}$，取 $(1,1)$、$(4,-1)$。读图约得 $x\\approx-1.67$、$x=1$；准确根为 $-\\frac{5}{3}$、$1$。\nf) $y=\\frac{-12x+10}{5}$，取 $(0,2)$、$(5,-10)$。读图约得 $x\\approx-3.05$、$x\\approx0.65$；准确根为 $\\frac{-6-\\sqrt{86}}{5}$、$\\frac{-6+\\sqrt{86}}{5}$。\n非整数交点的小数是便于对照的图解近似，不把有限刻度读数当作准确值。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "Six graphical tasks. Gives actual plotting construction and graph-read approximations; exact roots validate intersections, not a replacement for the requested graph."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "854",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "先把括号内的式子通分：\n$\\frac{2xy}{y^2-x^2}+\\frac{x}{x+y}-\\frac{y}{y-x}=\\frac{2xy+x(y-x)-y(x+y)}{(y-x)(x+y)}=\\frac{-(y-x)^2}{(y-x)(x+y)}=\\frac{x-y}{x+y}$。\n因此原式为\n$\\frac{(y-x)^2}{x+y}\\div\\frac{x-y}{x+y}=x-y$。\n上述变形要求 $x+y\\ne0$、$x-y\\ne0$。给定 $x=8.4$、$y=-0.6$ 满足这些条件，所以原式的值为 $8.4-(-0.6)=9$。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "One value task, with all original denominator and divisor constraints checked."
    }
